The data is the L01 land price (地価公示) data of the national land numerical
information of the Ministry of Land, Infrastructure, Transport and Tourism, Japan.
Credit: 「国土数値情報（地価公示データ）」（国土交通省）（https://nlftp.mlit.go.jp/ksj/gml/datalist/KsjTmplt-L01-2026.html）を加工して作成.
